1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,260
Understanding is art and not everyone is an artist. Some paint with their eyes.

2
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:11,760
Some paint with their ego. Only a few paint with their heart.

3
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:19,000
The greatest works are never hung on walls. They live quietly inside people's hearts.
